# 🚀 Why These Features Matter in React

These ES6+ features are used constantly when developing React applications.

```text
Functions
    ↓
Arrow Functions
    ↓
Destructuring
    ↓
Spread / Rest
    ↓
Modules
    ↓
Import / Export
    ↓
React Components
```

### Common React Examples

| JavaScript Feature | React Usage |
|---|---|
| Functions | Components & event handlers |
| Arrow Functions | Components & callbacks |
| Destructuring | Props & state |
| Spread | Updating objects/arrays |
| Rest | Handling multiple values |
| Import | Using components/modules |
| Export | Sharing components/modules |

