# 🧠 Quick Revision

| Concept | Example | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Function Declaration | `function add() {}` | Define reusable function |
| Function Expression | `const add = function() {}` | Store function in variable |
| Arrow Function | `const add = () => {}` | Short function syntax |
| Object Destructuring | `const {name} = user` | Extract object properties |
| Array Destructuring | `const [a,b] = arr` | Extract array values |
| Spread | `[...arr]` | Expand/copy values |
| Rest | `(...args)` | Collect values |
| Named Export | `export { add }` | Export multiple values |
| Default Export | `export default add` | Export one default value |
| Import | `import add from "./math"` | Use exported code |

